<title>AUSTRIA: Austria to tender 15 bln 6-yr bond on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Austria to tender 15 bln 6-yr bond on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Austria's Kontrollbank on Monday:</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Austria</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 15 billion ATS</p>
<p>MATURITY: 6 years</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: September 10, 1996</p>
<p>PAYMENT DATE: September 13, 1996</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 5312 274</p>
